{"slug": "linear.app", "name": "Linear", "category": "Productivity & SaaS", "summary": "Project management for engineers. Ultra-minimal, precise, purple accent", "description": "A near-black product-focused marketing canvas built around #010102 (the deepest dark surface of any tool in this collection), light gray text (#f7f8f8), and the signature Linear lavender-blue (#5e6ad2) used as the single chromatic accent. The system reads as software-craft documentation: dense, technical, and quietly luxurious. Display type is set in the Linear custom sans (SF Pro Display fallback) at 500–700 with measured negative tracking. Cards live as charcoal panels (#0f1011) with hairline borders. The accent lavender appears on the brand mark, focus rings, and a few intentional CTAs — never decoratively. Page rhythm leans on product UI screenshots framed in dark panels rather than atmospheric color.", "colors": [{"name": "Lavender Hover", "hex": "#828fff", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary-hover", "role": "Lighter lavender (#828fff) — hovered state of the primary CTA."}, {"name": "Lavender Focus", "hex": "#5e69d1", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary-focus", "role": "Focus-ring tint (#5e69d1) — focused inputs, focused buttons."}, {"name": "Brand Secure", "hex": "#7a7fad", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "brand-secure", "role": "Muted lavender-gray (#7a7fad) — used in \"Linear Security\" surfaces."}, {"name": "Canvas", "hex": "#010102", "group": "Surface", "token": "canvas", "role": "Default page background — #010102, near-pure black with a faint blue tint."}, {"name": "Ink", "hex": "#f7f8f8", "group": "Text", "token": "ink", "role": "All headlines and emphasized body type — light gray #f7f8f8."}, {"name": "Ink Muted", "hex": "#d0d6e0", "group": "Text", "token": "ink-muted", "role": "Secondary type at #d0d6e0 — meta info on hero panels."}, {"name": "Ink Subtle", "hex": "#8a8f98", "group": "Text", "token": "ink-subtle", "role": "Tertiary type at #8a8f98 — deselect